# Staged at pack time by the prepack script from the plugin root (one level up,
# beside .claude-plugin/), where these files actually live. npm only includes
# files inside the package directory, so without this staging the published
# tarball has no README and the npm page renders blank. postpack removes them.
/README.md
/LICENSE
/CHANGELOG.md
